[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `process_string` length shape | 0, 1, many, high-bit bytes, embedded NUL | `strlen` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `compare_allocations.val1` sign | `val1 > 0` vs `val1 <= 0` | `(*uninit_ptr > 0) ? 10 : 0` |
