[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    168[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    200,000 adjacent call pairs, alternation never once failed. A probe of
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    169[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    "N `arity4` calls, then read the phase" confirmed C and Rust advance the
